{"id":"624303","name":"黄瓜木耳拌鸡蛋","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624303/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半根"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"几朵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳泡发好。","img":"images/624303/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"摘洗干净放锅里煮开5分钟。","img":"images/624303/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再次洗净。","img":"images/624303/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取黄瓜。","img":"images/624303/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切滚刀块。","img":"images/624303/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋煮熟，过冷水，去壳。","img":"images/624303/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"所有食材放一起。","img":"images/624303/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"腊八蒜切碎，放腊八醋。","img":"images/624303/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食盐和生抽。","img":"images/624303/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/624303/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"浇在菜上即可。","img":"images/624303/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}